# Frontend Vue Rules

## Stack

- Vue 3
- Vite
- TypeScript
- Pinia
- Vue Router
- Element Plus
- Tailwind CSS

## UI Rules

- Every page must have loading, empty, error states.
- Use backend permissions to control menus and buttons.
- Backend must still enforce authorization.
- RAG answers must show citations in the UI.

## Structure

Recommended directories:

```text
src/api
src/components
src/layouts
src/router
src/stores
src/views
```

## API Client

- Use a single Axios instance.
- Handle 401 globally.
- Keep API modules separated by domain.
